*.log


# ======================== 5. 大体积 / 可重新获取的依赖 ========================
# Vosk 离线语音模型（约 65MB）：服务端首次部署需自行放置，
# 获取方式见 .workbuddy/memory/MEMORY.md「国内下大模型/大文件的可行通道」
app/Python_Backend/models/

# nncase 安装包（pip 可重装）；同目录的 libomp140*.dll 是运行时依赖，保留不忽略
*.whl

# 临时压缩包
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar


# ======================== 6. 敏感配置（只提交 *_template.h）========================
project1.1/Hardware/wifi_config_private.h
project1.1/Hardware/arduino_secrets.h
secrets.h
*.jks
*.keystore
local.properties


